 'Week 5 can feel emotionally overwhelming for many women. You may feel excited, anxious, emotional, grateful, nervous, or exhausted. Some women may begin worrying about miscarriage, symptoms, scans, or doing everything right. Gentle reminder: You do not need to be perfect to support your pregnancy.',
 '["Fatigue","Nausea","Sore breasts","Bloating","Mood changes","Food cravings or aversions","Little or no symptoms"]',
