 'Pregnancy hormones continue rising rapidly during Week 7. Your body is working hard to support placenta growth, increased blood flow, hormone production, and early fetal development. Fatigue and nausea may become stronger during this week for many women. Your body is using enormous energy internally, even if you cannot see it.',
